# Force LF line endings for everything in the repository and in any
# checkout/archive, regardless of the platform's core.autocrlf setting.
# Without this, `git archive` on Windows (as used to build/deploy the
# Docker image) can re-introduce CRLF into shell scripts like
# docker/entrypoint.sh, which then fail to exec inside the Linux container
# ("No such file or directory" from a CRLF-corrupted shebang line).
* text=auto eol=lf
